effect queryEchoHandler read http.request.query
effect queryEchoHandler write http.response
memory queryEchoHandler arena request
async queryEchoHandler no
useCapability queryEchoHandler httpRequestReader
useCapability queryEchoHandler httpResponseWriter
purpose queryEchoHandler "Return the raw value of the name query parameter"
invariant queryEchoHandler "Query values are raw split values; percent decoding is future work"

