arg bodyReadCall request request
run bodyReadCall
bind requestBodyText CNullTerminatedByteString bodyReadCall

call bodyMissingCheckCall pointer.isNull
arg bodyMissingCheckCall pointer requestBodyText
run bodyMissingCheckCall
bind bodyMissing Bool bodyMissingCheckCall
branchIf bodyMissing bodyEchoMissing

call bodyEchoResponseCall writeTextResponse
arg bodyEchoResponseCall response response
arg bodyEchoResponseCall status okStatus
arg bodyEchoResponseCall body requestBodyText
run bodyEchoResponseCall
bind bodyEchoResponseStatus CSignedInt32 bodyEchoResponseCall
returnValue bodyEchoResponseStatus

label bodyEchoMissing
call bodyMissingResponseCall writeTextResponse
arg bodyMissingResponseCall response response
arg bodyMissingResponseCall status badRequestStatus
arg bodyMissingResponseCall body bodyMissingBody
