operation requestLogMiddleware
input requestLogMiddleware request HttpRequest
input requestLogMiddleware response HttpResponse
output requestLogMiddleware MiddlewareControl
effect requestLogMiddleware read http.request.path
effect requestLogMiddleware write http.response
memory requestLogMiddleware arena request
async requestLogMiddleware no
useCapability requestLogMiddleware httpRequestReader
useCapability requestLogMiddleware httpResponseWriter
purpose requestLogMiddleware "Document desired middleware shape for request logging"
invariant requestLogMiddleware "The middleware returns continue status after inspecting the request path and setting a response marker header"
warning requestLogMiddleware "Middleware execution is synchronous and path-scoped; method-scoped middleware remains future work"

label startRequestLogMiddleware

const middlewareHeaderName CNullTerminatedByteString "X-Sem-Middleware"
const middlewareHeaderValue CNullTerminatedByteString "ran"
call middlewareHeaderCall http.responseHeader
arg middlewareHeaderCall response response
arg middlewareHeaderCall name middlewareHeaderName
arg middlewareHeaderCall value middlewareHeaderValue
run middlewareHeaderCall
ignoreValue middlewareHeaderCall CSignedInt32

call middlewarePathReadCall http.requestPath
arg middlewarePathReadCall request request
run middlewarePathReadCall
ignoreValue middlewarePathReadCall CNullTerminatedByteString

returnValue continueMiddlewareControl
